{"summary":"Enjoy the mermaids! Draw and paint mermaid coloring pages.","description":"Mermaids are the most fantastic and beautiful princesses of the ocean. Come in and enjoy all the mermaid coloring pages! This free coloring book contains over 200 coloring pages. \n\nYou can paint all designs with different colors and you can paint their hair and clothes. But you also have the option to create your own or work with stamps and stickers. It is also possible to add your own text to your drawing.\n\nIf you or your daughter likes mermaids she will also enjoy painting the models in this app.  And with all the colors you can choose from you can also do a makeover and color the makeup and hair of these beautiful girls. Can you make them look like a real mermaid?\n\nTake a look also at our other games with lovely designs for kids and adults. Drawing games to make beautiful pictures and stimulate the creativity of your son or daughter. We have lots of free painting and drawing games for everyone!\n\nAll mermaid coloring pages are copyright protected by 2 Monkeys","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $21.99 per item","video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g_qmcvl4pVqqgM-woBy55CS9VmROb9NtMgjlCgNToo93pJPT0ZGq581ViLSxiCy3XIwxuqIr-XDH-bJWSuSPyw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6GZb8--m-EgJv7h93BojMR4RUNeJp6zwUtF-EOSbCx-xnNAL_ffGGrdM4W7xH6pKn8mN8bA34et1xC1OoXuz","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l74t2wufHHNiYDkXKhGSmxCLSmpB4UU0Iu1gYjXTrHCa5OWJDmBt2LUvSeBxmBj27XLMlcMF7PtguUGu0ECiNPE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZWfEj7109b1z4cWIca1zR82CTQZ9bHL3vaqUq7hb3QTSuW5XJ5x23yyvdIyW4d6DjyqMT8VpoX6ld1AgzFxBzA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sHH-VHuVki30PFOnUXQtu-FVX1s3fCVGbSexGo-SPMtN9zTCwyRAcPX74kAWNrqOKithG2u9K5ZlVpSaJnqP","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MKiVsB1DTybCgW8H5Q2SV3DJOnN7CnAHBH1BpplMKKN1Bltw4I4iguGKJJe5U-FPtjXQP0uxrp8yds6omqD3RA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4Soj6eYeaSfLoBl4zo7L4